    {
      "source": "Return a new <a href=\"MeterValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.metrics.autoconfigure\"><code>MeterValue</code></a> instance for the given double value.",
      "translation": "返回给定双精度值的新<a href=\"MeterValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.metrics.autoconfigure\"><code>MeterValue</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A meter value that is used when configuring micrometer. Can be a String representation\nof either a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Double.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Double</code></a> (applicable to timers and distribution summaries) or a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a> (applicable to only timers).",
      "translation": "用于配置 Micrometer 的度量值。可以是 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Double.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Double</code></a>`（适用于计时器和分布摘要）或`<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration</code></a>`（仅适用于计时器）的字符串表示形式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a new <a href=\"MeterValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.metrics.autoconfigure\"><code>MeterValue</code></a> instance for the given String value. The value may\ncontain a simple number, or a <a href=\"../../../convert/DurationStyle.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>duration style string</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个新的<a href=\"MeterValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.metrics.autoconfigure\"><code>MeterValue</code></a>实例，用于给定的 String 值。该值可能包含一个简单的数字，或一个<a href=\"../../../convert/DurationStyle.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.convert\"><code>duration style string</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a new <a href=\"MeterValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.metrics.autoconfigure\"><code>MeterValue</code></a> instance for the given String value.",
      "translation": "返回给定 String 值的新<a href=\"MeterValue.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.metrics.autoconfigure\"><code>MeterValue</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the underlying value in form suitable to apply to the given meter type.",
      "translation": "返回适用于给定计量器类型的底层值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>meterType</code> - the meter type",
      "translation": "<code>meterType</code> - 计量器类型",
      "count": 2
